      "content": "i guess. but even the quiet corners feel empty. it's like i'm just taking up space that i don't need anymore. there's no point in trying to find a place when there isn't one for me. it just feels so... exhausted. like i've reached the end of my chapter and i'm just staring at a blank page.",
